From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:35:21 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] test(thread): judge the external M8 golden in
 posted_gates

The merged chain's guard (#862: every posted golden is judged or named
in UNJUDGED) now sees thread_mill_external_m8_multi_form.nc: the
posted_gates thread module regenerates it on the stud fixture (stock
cleared round the boss by the roughing ahead), proves it byte-identical
to its CL golden and runs the generator's blocking laws and the post's
verification gate. The stud world builders move from thread_boss.rs to
thread_support::boss so both suites share them.

Refs #985

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
